# turn_handlers — on turn N, on turn N-M, on turn N-, on turn -N

"Turn Handlers" by Test

Room cell "A bare stone cell."

on turn 1:
    say "You wake up on the cold floor."

on turn 3-5:
    say "Time passes slowly."

on turn 10-:
    say "You have been here a long time."

on turn -2:
    say "The first moments."

test
    test "turn start".
    test "turn range".

test "turn start"
    wait. "You wake up"

test "turn range"
    wait.
    wait.
    wait. "Time passes"
